license: MIT
version: 0.1.0.dev5
date-released: 2026-09-27
keywords:
  - nlp
  - text statistics
  - lexical diversity
  - cohesion
  - dependency syntax
  - corpus linguistics
  - stylometry
abstract: "anyTS is the language-independent core of text statistics libraries: the base of the sentence, word and character N-gram extractors with language hooks, lexical diversity measures, helpers for cohesion and for the dependency tree, collocations, dispersion, keyness, stylometric distances and the comparison of corpora."
